<h3>Notes</h3>

<p>
  <strong>Quota vs Capacity:</strong> Total effective GithubRunnerVCpuAws and GithubRunnerVCpuArmAws quota of the
  projects below, compared to the AWS runner vCPUs at which runners stop spilling over.
</p>

<p>
  <strong>Projects:</strong> Projects with the spill_to_alien_runners feature flag. GithubRunnerVCpuAws and
  GithubRunnerVCpuArmAws show AWS runner vCPUs against the effective quota. AWS has no 30 vCPU instance, so 30 vCPU
  runners count as 32.
</p>
